\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  c.bank says  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  effective-agency.  \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Mai 2005\par 12:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, May 3 (Reuters) - The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) considers its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week to halt a weakening of the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to have been effective, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Ivan Sramko was quoted on Tuesday as saying.  \par \par \uc2 The NBS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prop up its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday for the first time in more than two years, although it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly to slow a sharply rising crown earlier this year.  \par \par \uc2 "In our view, the crown had approached a level where it might have threatened our main inflation goal," the official TASR news agency quoted Sramko as saying. "That is why we reacted how we reacted, and the move proved to be effective."  \par \par \uc2 The bank started to buy crowns on the market when the unit touched a six-month low of 40.000 per euro. The crown traded at 39.265/295 to the euro as of 0930 GMT on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Sramko's comments echoed similar statements made by central bankers after the bank's monthly monetary policy meeting on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The NBS fought hard to slow what it considered too fast a crown firming for over a year. It bought three billion euros in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at halting the crown rise in the first quarter of this year.  \par \par \uc2 But the crown weakened sharply in the past month due to outflow of capital from central European markets, falling from all-time highs of 37.510 per euro seen early in March.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  volume was small compared with amounts of euros the bank bought in its attempts to slow crown firming, estimating that the NBS might have sold up to 200 million euros on the market.  \par \par \uc2 The NBS has not elaborated on Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but Sramko reaffirmed on Tuesday that the bank would stay ready to use its tools to protect its inflation goals.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050503e1530038s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
