\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to weaken crown.   \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2005\par 12:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, March 7 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold crowns directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market again on Monday to rein in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which had surged to a new record high to the euro.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Igor Barat confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had taken place, but gave no details of the action. Dealers said the bank stepped into the market shortly after the crown hit 37.510 per euro, its strongest level ever.   \par \par \uc2 The National Bank of Slovakia bank has been trying to slow the crown's rise for more than a year, using all the tools available to it to discourage \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS has frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the market this year, saying the crown's rise has been too fast and dangerous for the economy.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also cut the main two-week repo rate by 100 basis points to 3.00 percent in February to make the unit less attractive for short-term capital.   \par \par \uc2 The crown's latest record high marked a three percent gain since the beginning of the year, and most analysts predict more firming pressure on the crown due to Slovakia's solid economic fundamentals and expected foreign direct investment inflows.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened the crown only slightly, pushing it to 37.610/630 per euro as of 1130 GMT.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050307e1370088e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
