ight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's determination to control the pace of crown appreciation has sparked expectations of an interest rate cut at Monday's February monetary policy meeting, with some analysts expecting a reduction of as much as 100 basis points.    \par \par \uc2  The main two-week repo rate stands at 4.00 percent after the bank cut 200 basis points last year to discourage speculators.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050224e12o0080z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
