\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to rein in crown.   \b0\par\par\uc2 487 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 2005\par 10:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Feb 23 (Reuters) - The Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  resumed its long battle against a sharp rise of the crown on Wednesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a record high of 37.870 per euro. The crown started surging after the local market close on Tuesday, breaking beyond the psychological level of 38.0 per euro, which has been long defended by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) has used a mix of direct market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and repo tenders to halt the unit's rise in recent weeks. Its action on Wednesday was the second direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week and eighth such move this year. "I can confirm we are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The reasons remain the same as with the previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Igor Barat told Reuters.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers estimated the NBS bought roughly 200 million euros in Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , less then estimated 300 million euros on Monday. The NBS has been trying to fight off inflows of speculative capital for more than a year to counter what it sees as unwarranted exchange rate moves, using its entire arsenal.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS has been criticised by analysts and international institutions such as the International Monetary Fund for managing the exchange rate too tightly, but the bank said too strong a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could harm the economy and endanger adoption of the euro.   \par \par \uc2 The crown eased to 37.966 to the euro following the NBS action. But it recovered quickly to trade at 37.890/930 per euro at 0815 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts said the NBS strategy would curb firming pressure on the crown only temporarily, saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had potential to rise further in the longer-term due to an improving performance of the new EU member's economy.   \par \par \uc2 "We believe that the Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will lose the battle against the fundamentals in the long run," said Danske Bank analyst Christian Vincens. "The fundamentals and the structural nature of the Slovak economy is too solid to have the crown trading at these levels."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it did not oppose a gradual firming of the crown, but said the exchange rate movements were often inappropriate compared with real improvements to the country's economic trends.   \par \par \uc2 The market expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cut interest rates formally by 75-150 basis points this month to bring the key two week repo rate in line with interbank deposit rates, which fell sharply in the past weeks due to the NBS's repo tender tactics.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rejected all bids in its last four repo auctions to reduce the crown's attractiveness to short-term capital.   \par \par \uc2 The NBS slashed borrowing costs by 200 basis points last year, bringing the two-week repo rate to 4.0 percent, but later turned to \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the rate cuts failed to weaken the crown.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050223e12n006rt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
