\par\par \b \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on Feb 18.  \b0\par\par\uc2 342 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Februar 2005\par 08:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Feb 18 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Slovak financial markets on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 C.BANK TO RELEASE \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  RESERVES DATA  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will release its weekly foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves data.  \par \par \uc2 C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENES\b0 \highlight\uc2  AGAIN TO REIN IN CROWN  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold crowns for euros directly on the market on Thursday in the latest stage of its long fight against fast \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation.  \par \par \uc2 The direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the third such action in the past two weeks which began when the crown rose close to all-time highs of 38.000 per euro, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 IMF SAYS C.BANK SHOULD RELAX MORE ON CROWN RISE  \par \par \uc2 The Slovak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should ease its opposition to crown appreciation in order to achieve its main inflation targets, the International Monetary Fund said in a report on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 GOVT EYES TENDERS TO SELL STAKES IN SSE AND VSE  \par \par \uc2 Slovakia might offer minority stakes in two electricity distributors SSE and VSE in international tenders, instead of selling the shares to current strategic investors from France and Germany, the economy minister said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 GOVT SIGNS CONTRACT WITH ENEL ON SE SALE  \par \par \uc2 The government signed transaction documents with Italy's utility Enel (ENEI.MI) on the sale of Slovakia's dominant power producer Slovenske Elektrarne (SE).  \par \par \uc2 United States and other Group of Seven countries, see . For a diary of forthcoming Slovak events, double click  \par \par \uc2 , and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see.  \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Peter Laca on +421 2 5341 8402; fax: +421 2 5341 8403  \par \par \uc2 E-mail: bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com  \par \par \uc2 Reuters Messaging: peter.laca.reuters.com@reuters.net   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For real-time index quotes, double click in brackets: Warsaw WIG20\par Budapest BUX        Prague PX50         Other related news:\par  \par   Slovak equities              E.Europe equities\par   Slovak money                 Czech debt\par   Slovak Indicators            Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par   Eastern European             All emerging markets\par   Hot stocks                   Stock markets\par   Market debt news             \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news\par   TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets\par   TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050218e12i007sz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
