\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbanker says  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  a success.  \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 2005\par 14:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Jan 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Ivan Sramko said on Wednesday recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the rise of the crown against the euro was a success.  \par \par \uc2 "I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  had their desired impact (on the exchange rate)," Sramko also told reporters after a government meeting.  \par \par \uc2 "We have said we would allow a certain appreciation of the real exchange rate, but certainly if the nominal exchange rate rises too quickly, we will use all of our tools (to slow the rise) but we would allow an appreciation that we see as good for the economy," he added.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought 100-250 million euros from the market on Monday, when the crown hit an all-time high of 38.500 to the euro . At 1306 GMT on Wednesday it was at 38.685 to the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Slovakia became a darling of foreign investors due to labour market and tax reforms as well as government investment aid. BUt the result has been strong upward pressure on the crown as investment inflows created demand for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Sramko declined to comment on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had room to ease policy despite recent data showing strong growth in domestic demand.  \par \par \uc2 But he did say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw no signs that reviving household spending would endanger its inflation goals this year.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is targeting inflation for 2005 at 3-4 percent.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050112e11c00dl9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
