\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW-UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Slovak \highlight\uc2  cbank - crown  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  successful.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Martin Dokoupil  \par \uc2 373 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Januar 2005\par 11:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Jan 1 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Ivan Sramko said on Saturday that recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the sharp rise of the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the euro were successful.  \par \par \uc2 He also told Reuters after being officially approved as the new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor by the president that further actions to stem the crown's rise are on the cards if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firms out of line with economic developments.  \par \par \uc2 "The basic goal we had with the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to prevent the crown from excessive firming ... and this was met," he said in a brief interview after the swearing in ceremony, noting that a two to three percent real annual rise in the crown was realistic.  \par \par \uc2 "We will continue to monitor the crown and as we have said (after December's monetary policy meeting), if the firming is not in line with economic developments, we will use all tools to correct it," he added.  \par \par \uc2 The Slovak crown closed 38.723/773 to the euro on Friday, ending the year more than six percent stronger helped by a series of positive economic data and FDI news, which fuelled its late-year charge.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to counter the crown's strength last week, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  jumped to an all-time high of 38.530 per euro following its two-month rally.  \par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not move to ease interest rates at its final policy meeting of the year in December, and Sramko said current settings are correct.  \par \par \uc2 "We think that according to our latest decision, the monetary policy settings are good and are in line with conditions in the Slovak economy," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts expect the bank to shift its focus in 2005 to inflation targeting from correcting the exchange rate moves after the recent changes to its policy-making board including replacement of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Marian Jusko, whose term ended on Dec. 31.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the crown would probably pick up steam again later in January to wage a fresh attack on record highs to the euro, adding it might firm to levels of around 38.0 per euro by the end of the first quarter.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050101e111005ha\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
