\par\par \b \uc2 Slovakia - Factors To Watch on Dec 23.  \b0\par\par\uc2 361 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 2004\par 09:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BRATISLAVA, Dec 23 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  financial markets on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENES\b0 \highlight\uc2  TO WEAKEN CROWN  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday, selling its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of its long-lasting effort to prevent the rising crown from hurting the economy.  \par \par \uc2 The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) has been trying to rein in the crown for more than a year, saying the unit's advance is too quick and does not correspond to fundamentals in the new EU member's economy.  \par \par \uc2 CROWN FALLS AFTER C.BANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Slovak\b0 \highlight\uc2  crown weakened on Wednesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the market to slow the unit's appreciation, but dealers said they did not expect further major losses in the coming days.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market with crown sales when its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded near all-time highs of around 38.550 per euro early in the session.  \par \par \uc2 SLOVALCO PICKS THREE BANKS FOR $100 MLN LOAN  \par \par \uc2 Slovak aluminium smelter Slovalco has picked three banks for a $100 million loan to refinance existing debt and cut borrowing costs for its \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Financial and Commercial Director Rudolf Knapp told Reuters.  \par \par \uc2 Slovalco, run by Norway's Norsk Hydro (NHY.OL), had mandated Citigroup (C.N), ING (ING.AS) and Slovak bank Tatra Banka to be the lead arrangers of the new credit.  \par \par \uc2 United States and other Group of Seven countries, see .  \par \par \uc2 For a diary of forthcoming Slovak events, double click  \par \par \uc2 , and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see.  \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Peter Laca on +421 2 5341 8402; fax: +421 2 5341 8403  \par \par \uc2 E-mail: bratislava.newsroom@reuters.com  \par \par \uc2 Reuters Messaging: peter.laca.reuters.com@reuters.net   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For real-time index quotes, double click in brackets: Warsaw WIG20\par Budapest BUX        Prague PX50         Other related news:\par  \par   Slovak equities              E.Europe equities\par   Slovak money                 Czech debt\par   Slovak Indicators            Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par   Eastern European             All emerging markets\par   Hot stocks                   Stock markets\par   Market debt news             \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news\par   TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets\par   TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041223e0cn007k9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
